OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FPresident Donald Trump secretly flew
OL,7,Fout of a Nato summit on an alternate
OL,8,Fmilitary aircraft while the White
OL,9,FHouse made it appear that he was
OL,10,Fflying on Air Force One, The
OL,11,FWashington Post reported.
OL,13,FThe operation was prompted by an
OL,14,FIranian assassination threat against
OL,15,FTrump last month at a summit in
OL,16,FAnkara, Turkey.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
