OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FThe ruse was carried out as
OL,7,Fjournalists and some White House staff
OL,8,Fmembers were led to believe they were
OL,9,Fon the same plane as the president as
OL,10,Fhe began his journey back to
OL,11,FWashington.
OL,13,FThe Post cited material reviewed by
OL,14,Fthe newspaper, a US official familiar
OL,15,Fwith the operation and another person
OL,16,Fwith knowledge of the president's
OL,17,Ftravel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FIn Ankara, Trump boarded the old Air
OL,7,FForce One jumbo jet in view of
OL,8,Ftelevision cameras before the plane
OL,9,Fflew to Royal Air Force Mildenhall in
OL,10,Fthe United Kingdom.
OL,12,FHowever, according to the Post report,
OL,13,Fafter boarding the legacy Air Force
OL,14,FOne jet, he was secretly shuttled
OL,15,Fminutes later to a smaller plane, an
OL,16,FAir Force C-32A, via an airport
OL,17,Fcatering truck typically used to load
OL,18,Fmeals and other supplies.
OL,20,FTrump flew to Mildenhall on that
OL,21,Fsmaller jet.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
