CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FThe White House did not respond to
OL,7,Fquestions about the report.
OL,9,F"As the President has said recently,
OL,10,Fthere are many enemies of America who
OL,11,Fhave their sights on him, and we use
OL,12,Fevery tool at our disposal to address
OL,13,Fthose threats," White House
OL,14,Fcommunications director Steven Cheung
OL,15,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,17,FWhile Trump was in Turkey, the US
OL,18,Fmilitary conducted a series of large
OL,19,Fstrikes in Iran in retaliation for its
OL,20,Fattacks on merchant shipping in the
OL,21,Fregion.
OL,26,@qD@AOUuD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
