OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FThe Post reported that to exit that
OL,7,Fplane without being seen by those
OL,8,Funinvolved in the operation, Trump and
OL,9,Fseveral aides stepped aboard an
OL,10,Fairport catering truck, which was
OL,11,Felevated planeside using hydraulics
OL,12,Fand positioned at a door on the
OL,13,Fopposite side of Air Force One's
OL,14,Fentrance.
OL,16,FThe small group of reporters who
OL,17,Fthought they were travelling with
OL,18,FTrump were advised to lower their
OL,19,Fwindow shades ahead of takeoff.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
