PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FAfter arriving at Mildenhall, news
OL,7,Fphotographers captured images of Trump
OL,8,Fgetting off the presidential plane `
OL,9,Fsuggesting he reboarded Air Force One
OL,10,Fout of sight of the pack of
OL,11,Fjournalists who thought they were
OL,12,Ftravelling with him.
OL,14,FAfter the brief visit to the base at
OL,15,FMildenhall, Trump boarded the new Air
OL,16,FForce One aircraft to fly the rest of
OL,17,Fthe way to Washington.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
