OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FDuring a gaggle with reporters aboard
OL,7,Fthe aircraft, Trump was asked directly
OL,8,Fif there were any credible threats on
OL,9,FAir Force One by Iran.
OL,11,F"Well, I have a threat all the time.
OL,12,FI'm number one on their list before
OL,13,Fyou," Trump said. He added to the
OL,14,Ftraveling reporters, "But if I go, you
OL,15,Fgo."
OL,17,FTrump had flown to the summit in a new
OL,18,FQatari-gifted and retrofitted red,
OL,19,Fwhite and navy blue jet.
OL,26,@sD@AOUuD@EO]vD@VOUwD@DO]
