OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1786520878
OL,3,CHow Trump reportedly boarded a secret
OL,4,Cflight using a catering container
OL,6,FThe New York Times and CBS News
OL,7,Freported last month that intelligence
OL,8,Fofficials had raised concerns about a
OL,9,Fpotential attack on the president or
OL,10,Fhis jet, triggering additional
OL,11,Fprecautions and the decision not to
OL,12,Fuse the newly inaugurated aircraft
OL,13,Fgifted to Trump by Qatar for the first
OL,14,Fleg of Trump's trip home from Ankara.
OL,16,FThe swap had spurred questions about
OL,17,Fthe security of the Qatar-provided
OL,18,Faircraft, and Trump said last month
OL,19,Fafter the trip that it would undergo
OL,20,Fadditional upgrades.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
